# Git y PRs (Rocha)

Baseline: global `git-and-prs.mdc` + `pr-always-draft.mdc`. This file = repo deltas only.

## Hard requirements

- Feature/fix PRs: `gh pr create --draft --base development` — never mark ready unless user asks
- No merge to `development`/`main` without explicit user yes
- Release = PR `development → main` only
- Commits/PR bodies: English; template `.github/pull_request_template.md`
- Validate: `npx tsc --noEmit` + `npm run lint`
- Additive `prisma db push` OK without ask — see `prisma-db-push.mdc`; lossy needs confirm
- Stash: list on task start; `wip: <qué>`; pop ASAP; no orphan stashes

## Antes de codear

1. `git fetch origin development`
2. `git checkout development && git pull`
3. Clean tree (or stash other work)
4. `git checkout -b <prefijo>/<nombre-corto>`
5. Tell user the branch name

## Naming

`feat|fix|refactor|chore|docs/<kebab-case>` — one task per branch.

## CI note

Draft = no Actions/preview until Ready — `draft-pr-checks.mdc`. Build = Vercel (not Actions yet). Merge = squash + delete branch.
